  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Within three months of the date of this decision, the proposed stone capping should be restored and the section of front brick wall to the left of the flood gate should be re-instated to its former height and thereafter retained and maintained.\r\n\r\nReason: To maintain a high quality of visual amenity in the scheme in accordance with policies D1 and D2 of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017 and policy CK1 of the Kilburn Neighbourhood Plan 2023-2033 (referendum version).\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - Within three months of the date of this decision, the front wooden flood gate shown on the elevations shall be painted black in colour.\r\n\r\nReason: To safeguard the appearance of the premises and the character of the immediate area in accordance with the requirements of policies D1 and D2 of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017 and policy CK1 of the Kilburn Neighbourhood Plan 2023-2033 (referendum version).",
    "Condition : 3 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\n\r\nLocation plan; BRG05; BRG04A.\r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning.\r\n"
